.ruff_cache/

# Traces derived from real traffic. The segment names in a trace are a description
# of somebody's prompts -- a system prompt's identity, a tool schema's presence, how
# long each turn was. The repository ships synthetic traces only.
tests/traces/*.local.csv
# Anchored to the repository root. Written without the leading slash this
# pattern also matches tests/traces/, which silently kept every synthetic
# fixture out of the published repository while every local run passed.
/traces/
